<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" xmlns:th="http://www.thymeleaf.org">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>PeopleFlow | Employee Management System</title>

<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>

<link
	href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@600;700;800&display=swap"
	rel="stylesheet">

<style>
:root {
	--navy: #14213d;
	--blue: #2563eb;
	--blue-dark: #1d4ed8;
	--sky: #eff6ff;
	--mint: #dcfce7;
	--green: #16a34a;
	--orange: #f97316;
	--text: #1e293b;
	--muted: #64748b;
	--border: #e2e8f0;
	--white: #ffffff;
	--bg: #f8fafc;
	--shadow: 0 16px 45px rgba(30, 64, 175, 0.12);
}

* {
	box-sizing: border-box;
	margin: 0;
	padding: 0;
}

body {
	font-family: "DM Sans", sans-serif;
	color: var(--text);
	background: var(--bg);
	overflow-x: hidden;
}

a {
	text-decoration: none;
	color: inherit;
}

.container {
	width: min(1180px, calc(100% - 40px));
	margin: auto;
}

/* Navigation */
header {
	background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.94);
	backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
	border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
	position: sticky;
	top: 0;
	z-index: 10;
}

.navbar {
	height: 76px;
	display: flex;
	align-items: center;
	justify-content: space-between;
	gap: 24px;
}

.brand {
	display: flex;
	align-items: center;
	gap: 11px;
	font-family: "Plus Jakarta Sans", sans-serif;
	font-size: 1.32rem;
	font-weight: 800;
	color: var(--navy);
}

.brand-mark {
	width: 38px;
	height: 38px;
	display: grid;
	place-items: center;
	border-radius: 11px;
	color: white;
	background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2563eb, #4f46e5);
	box-shadow: 0 7px 15px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.27);
}

nav {
	display: flex;
	align-items: center;
	gap: 28px;
	color: #475569;
	font-size: 0.94rem;
	font-weight: 600;
}

nav a:hover {
	color: var(--blue);
}

.nav-actions {
	display: flex;
	gap: 10px;
	align-items: center;
}

.btn {
	display: inline-flex;
	align-items: center;
	justify-content: center;
	gap: 8px;
	border: none;
	cursor: pointer;
	font: inherit;
	font-weight: 700;
	border-radius: 10px;
	padding: 12px 18px;
	transition: 0.2s ease;
}

.btn-outline {
	color: var(--blue);
	border: 1px solid #bfdbfe;
	background: #fff;
}

.btn-outline:hover {
	background: var(--sky);
	transform: translateY(-1px);
}

.btn-primary {
	color: white;
	background: var(--blue);
	box-shadow: 0 8px 18px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.22);
}

.btn-primary:hover {
	background: var(--blue-dark);
	transform: translateY(-2px);
}

/* Hero */
.hero {
	position: relative;
	overflow: hidden;
	padding: 85px 0 75px;
	background: radial-gradient(circle at 85% 20%, rgba(147, 197, 253, 0.38),
		transparent 27%),
		radial-gradient(circle at 20% 90%, rgba(167, 243, 208, 0.36),
		transparent 25%),
		linear-gradient(135deg, #f8fbff 0%, #eff6ff 55%, #f0fdf4 100%);
}

.hero::before, .hero::after {
	content: "";
	position: absolute;
	border-radius: 50%;
	border: 1px solid rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.1);
}

.hero::before {
	width: 530px;
	height: 530px;
	top: -350px;
	right: -120px;
}

.hero::after {
	width: 360px;
	height: 360px;
	bottom: -260px;
	left: -110px;
}

.hero-grid {
	position: relative;
	display: grid;
	grid-template-columns: 1fr 0.95fr;
	align-items: center;
	gap: 55px;
}

.eyebrow {
	display: inline-flex;
	align-items: center;
	gap: 8px;
	padding: 8px 12px;
	border: 1px solid #bfdbfe;
	border-radius: 99px;
	background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75);
	color: var(--blue);
	font-size: 0.83rem;
	font-weight: 700;
}

.pulse {
	width: 8px;
	height: 8px;
	background: #22c55e;
	border-radius: 50%;
	box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px #dcfce7;
}

h1 {
	max-width: 650px;
	margin: 18px 0;
	font-family: "Plus Jakarta Sans", sans-serif;
	color: var(--navy);
	font-size: clamp(2.35rem, 4.2vw, 4.25rem);
	line-height: 1.12;
	letter-spacing: -0.05em;
}

h1 span {
	color: var(--blue);
}

.hero-text {
	max-width: 570px;
	color: var(--muted);
	font-size: 1.08rem;
	line-height: 1.75;
}

.hero-buttons {
	display: flex;
	flex-wrap: wrap;
	gap: 13px;
	margin-top: 28px;
}

.btn-large {
	padding: 15px 21px;
}

.trust-row {
	display: flex;
	align-items: center;
	gap: 12px;
	margin-top: 30px;
	color: #64748b;
	font-size: 0.9rem;
	font-weight: 600;
}

.avatars {
	display: flex;
}

.avatar {
	width: 31px;
	height: 31px;
	display: grid;
	place-items: center;
	margin-right: -8px;
	border: 2px solid white;
	border-radius: 50%;
	color: white;
	font-size: 0.66rem;
	font-weight: 800;
}

.a1 {
	background: #f97316;
}

.a2 {
	background: #8b5cf6;
}

.a3 {
	background: #0ea5e9;
}

.a4 {
	background: #14b8a6;
}

/* Dashboard preview */
.dashboard {
	position: relative;
	border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
	border-radius: 20px;
	padding: 18px;
	background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.88);
	box-shadow: var(--shadow);
	transform: rotate(1.5deg);
}

.dashboard-top {
	display: flex;
	justify-content: space-between;
	align-items: center;
	margin-bottom: 16px;
}

.mini-brand {
	color: var(--navy);
	font-weight: 800;
	font-size: 0.9rem;
}

.dots {
	color: #94a3b8;
	letter-spacing: 2px;
}

.dashboard-content {
	display: grid;
	grid-template-columns: 112px 1fr;
	gap: 15px;
}

.side-panel {
	padding: 15px 10px;
	border-radius: 12px;
	color: #64748b;
	background: #f8fafc;
	font-size: 0.67rem;
	line-height: 2.8;
	font-weight: 700;
}

.side-panel .selected {
	display: block;
	padding-left: 8px;
	border-radius: 6px;
	color: var(--blue);
	background: #dbeafe;
}

.main-panel {
	min-width: 0;
}

.welcome-card {
	display: flex;
	justify-content: space-between;
	padding: 14px;
	border-radius: 11px;
	color: white;
	background: linear-gradient(125deg, #2563eb, #4f46e5);
}

.welcome-card small {
	opacity: 0.82;
	font-size: 0.66rem;
}

.welcome-card strong {
	display: block;
	margin-top: 4px;
	font-size: 0.9rem;
}

.stats {
	display: grid;
	grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
	gap: 8px;
	margin: 12px 0;
}

.stat {
	padding: 10px;
	border: 1px solid var(--border);
	border-radius: 9px;
	background: white;
}

.stat small {
	display: block;
	color: #94a3b8;
	font-size: 0.58rem;
	font-weight: 700;
}

.stat b {
	display: block;
	margin-top: 4px;
	color: var(--navy);
	font-size: 1rem;
}

.employee-list {
	padding: 11px;
	border: 1px solid var(--border);
	border-radius: 10px;
	background: white;
}

.employee-list h4 {
	margin-bottom: 9px;
	font-size: 0.73rem;
}

.employee {
	display: flex;
	align-items: center;
	gap: 8px;
	padding: 6px 0;
	border-top: 1px solid #f1f5f9;
}

.employee:first-of-type {
	border-top: 0;
}

.employee-photo {
	width: 24px;
	height: 24px;
	display: grid;
	place-items: center;
	border-radius: 50%;
	color: white;
	font-size: 0.54rem;
	font-weight: 800;
}

.employee-info {
	flex: 1;
}

.employee-info b, .employee-info span {
	display: block;
}

.employee-info b {
	color: #334155;
	font-size: 0.61rem;
}

.employee-info span {
	color: #94a3b8;
	font-size: 0.52rem;
}

.online {
	width: 6px;
	height: 6px;
	border-radius: 50%;
	background: #22c55e;
}

.floating-card {
	position: absolute;
	right: -28px;
	bottom: 25px;
	display: flex;
	align-items: center;
	gap: 10px;
	padding: 11px 14px;
	border: 1px solid #dcfce7;
	border-radius: 12px;
	background: white;
	box-shadow: 0 13px 30px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.14);
	transform: rotate(-3deg);
}

.check-icon {
	width: 28px;
	height: 28px;
	display: grid;
	place-items: center;
	border-radius: 50%;
	color: #15803d;
	background: #dcfce7;
	font-weight: 800;
}

.floating-card b {
	display: block;
	color: #334155;
	font-size: 0.72rem;
}

.floating-card small {
	color: #64748b;
	font-size: 0.63rem;
}

/* Quick actions */
.actions {
	padding: 78px 0;
}

.section-heading {
	max-width: 670px;
	margin: 0 auto 35px;
	text-align: center;
}

.section-heading h2 {
	margin-bottom: 10px;
	color: var(--navy);
	font-family: "Plus Jakarta Sans", sans-serif;
	font-size: 2rem;
	letter-spacing: -0.04em;
}

.section-heading p {
	color: var(--muted);
	line-height: 1.6;
}

.action-grid {
	display: grid;
	grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
	gap: 20px;
}

.action-card {
	position: relative;
	overflow: hidden;
	padding: 27px;
	border: 1px solid var(--border);
	border-radius: 17px;
	background: white;
	transition: 0.25s ease;
}

.action-card:hover {
	border-color: #bfdbfe;
	box-shadow: 0 14px 30px rgba(30, 64, 175, 0.1);
	transform: translateY(-6px);
}

.card-icon {
	width: 48px;
	height: 48px;
	display: grid;
	place-items: center;
	margin-bottom: 18px;
	border-radius: 13px;
	font-size: 1.4rem;
}

.add-icon {
	background: #dbeafe;
}

.view-icon {
	background: #dcfce7;
}

.report-icon {
	background: #ffedd5;
}

.action-card h3 {
	margin-bottom: 9px;
	color: var(--navy);
	font-family: "Plus Jakarta Sans", sans-serif;
	font-size: 1.16rem;
}

.action-card p {
	min-height: 52px;
	color: var(--muted);
	font-size: 0.92rem;
	line-height: 1.55;
}

.card-link {
	display: inline-flex;
	margin-top: 17px;
	color: var(--blue);
	font-size: 0.9rem;
	font-weight: 800;
}

.card-link:hover {
	text-decoration: underline;
}

/* Footer */
footer {
	padding: 24px 0;
	border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
	background: white;
}

.footer-content {
	display: flex;
	justify-content: space-between;
	align-items: center;
	color: var(--muted);
	font-size: 0.88rem;
}

.footer-links {
	display: flex;
	gap: 18px;
}

.footer-links a:hover {
	color: var(--blue);
}

@media ( max-width : 850px) {
	nav {
		display: none;
	}
	.hero-grid {
		grid-template-columns: 1fr;
	}
	.dashboard {
		max-width: 520px;
		margin: 15px auto 0;
	}
	.action-grid {
		grid-template-columns: 1fr;
	}
}

@media ( max-width : 520px) {
	.navbar {
		height: 68px;
	}
	.nav-actions .btn-outline {
		display: none;
	}
	.hero {
		padding: 58px 0;
	}
	.dashboard-content {
		grid-template-columns: 85px 1fr;
	}
	.floating-card {
		right: -8px;
	}
	.footer-content {
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 12px;
	}
}
</style>

</head>

<body>
	<header>
		<div class="container navbar">
			<a href="#" class="brand"> <span class="brand-mark">PF</span>
				PeopleFlow
			</a>

			<nav>
				<a href="#home">Home</a> <a href="#features">Features</a> <a
					href="#employees">Employees</a> <a href="#reports">Reports</a>
			</nav>

			<div class="nav-actions">
				<a href="login.html" class="btn btn-outline">Login</a> <a
					href="logout.html" class="btn btn-primary">Logout</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</header>

	<main>
		<section class="hero" id="home">
			<div class="container hero-grid">
				<div>
					<div class="eyebrow">
						<span class="pulse"></span> Smart workforce management
					</div>

					<h1>
						Manage your people. <span>Empower your business.</span>
					</h1>

					<p class="hero-text">A simple, secure, and efficient way to
						manage your workforce— from employee records and attendance to
						team insights.</p>

					<div class="hero-buttons">
						<a href="add-employee.html" class="btn btn-primary btn-large">
							<span>＋</span> Add Employee
						</a> <a href="/employees/" class="btn btn-outline btn-large">
							View Employees → </a>
					</div>

					<div class="trust-row">
						<div class="avatars">
							<span class="avatar a1">AM</span> <span class="avatar a2">JS</span>
							<span class="avatar a3">RK</span> <span class="avatar a4">+2K</span>
						</div>
						Trusted by teams managing 2,000+ employees
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="dashboard">
					<div class="dashboard-top">
						<span class="mini-brand">PeopleFlow Dashboard</span> <span
							class="dots">•••</span>
					</div>

					<div class="dashboard-content">
						<aside class="side-panel">
							<span class="selected">▣ Dashboard</span> <span>♙
								Employees</span> <span>◷ Attendance</span> <span>▤ Reports</span> <span>⚙
								Settings</span>
						</aside>

						<div class="main-panel">
							<div class="welcome-card">
								<div>
									<small>Good morning, Admin</small> <strong>Here is
										your team overview</strong>
								</div>
								<span>👋</span>
							</div>

							<div class="stats">
								<div class="stat">
									<small>TOTAL EMPLOYEES</small> <b>1,248</b>
								</div>
								<div class="stat">
									<small>PRESENT TODAY</small> <b>1,196</b>
								</div>
								<div class="stat">
									<small>ON LEAVE</small> <b>32</b>
								</div>
							</div>

							<div class="employee-list">
								<h4>Recent Employees</h4>

								<div class="employee">
									<span class="employee-photo a1">AM</span>
									<div class="employee-info">
										<b>Amelia Morgan</b> <span>Product Designer</span>
									</div>
									<span class="online"></span>
								</div>

								<div class="employee">
									<span class="employee-photo a2">JD</span>
									<div class="employee-info">
										<b>James Davis</b> <span>Software Engineer</span>
									</div>
									<span class="online"></span>
								</div>

								<div class="employee">
									<span class="employee-photo a3">SR</span>
									<div class="employee-info">
										<b>Sarah Robinson</b> <span>HR Manager</span>
									</div>
									<span class="online"></span>
								</div>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="floating-card">
						<span class="check-icon">✓</span>
						<div>
							<b>Employee added!</b> <small>Profile successfully
								created</small>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="actions" id="features">
			<div class="container">
				<div class="section-heading">
					<h2>Everything your team needs, in one place</h2>
					<p>Streamline everyday HR tasks and keep your employee
						information organized, accessible, and secure.</p>
				</div>

				<div class="action-grid">
					<article class="action-card">
						<div class="card-icon add-icon">👤</div>
						<h3>Add Employee</h3>
						<p>Create employee profiles, assign departments, roles, and
							contact details with ease.</p>
						<a href="add-employee.html" class="card-link">Add a new
							employee →</a>
					</article>

					<article class="action-card" id="employees">
						<div class="card-icon view-icon">👥</div>
						<h3>View Employees</h3>
						<p>Browse, search, filter, and update all employee records
							from one central directory.</p>
						<a th:href="@{/employees/}" class="card-link">Open employee
							directory →</a>
					</article>

					<article class="action-card" id="reports">
						<div class="card-icon report-icon">📊</div>
						<h3>Reports & Insights</h3>
						<p>Track attendance, team growth, department data, and
							workforce performance.</p>
						<a href="reports.html" class="card-link">View reports →</a>
					</article>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>
	</main>

	<footer>
		<div class="container footer-content">
			<p>© 2026 PeopleFlow. Employee management made simple.</p>
			<div class="footer-links">
				<a href="#">Help Center</a> <a href="#">Privacy</a> <a
					href="logout.html">Logout</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</footer>
</body>
</html>